<%# Layout for the STYLED gallery slides (Boards::Printables::RenderStyledSlides):
    4:3, warm cream with soft pink and gentle green accents, a rounded navy
    headline and handwritten corner notes.

    Its own layout rather than a variant of listing_image.html.erb: that one is
    shared with the listing video's frames and binds every accent colour to the
    per-listing Palette rotation. This design is one fixed brand look, so its
    colours are fixed tokens here.

    The rails listing_image.html.erb documents still hold:
    1. Nothing is fetched over the network by the chrome. Nunito, Fredoka and
       Caveat are inlined by Boards::Printables::Fonts.styled_face_css; the logo
       is a data URI. The board symbol art inside a page render is the one
       exception, exactly as it is on the printed page.
    2. No emoji and no glyph outside the fonts. Icons are inline SVG.
    3. Every box is fixed and the copy that fills it is bounded
       (Printables::StyledSlideCopy). %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Styled listing image</title>

    <style>
      <%# Unescaped: this is CSS inside <style>, where HTML entities are never
          decoded — an escaped `'Caveat'` arrives as `&#39;Caveat&#39;`, the
          @font-face is dropped as invalid, and the slide renders in the fallback
          with no error anywhere. The string is built from constants and
          base64, never from user input. %>
      <%== Boards::Printables::Fonts.styled_face_css %>

      :root {
        --cream: #FBF6EC;
        --pink: #E589B3;
        --pink-deep: #B8407A;
        --pink-soft: #F9D8E6;
        --green: #56B58C;
        --green-deep: #2F7D5B;
        --green-soft: #CFEBDA;
        --navy: #17385C;
        --ink-soft: #4A5B6C;
        --white: #FFFFFF;

        --shadow-page: 0 18px 40px rgba(23, 56, 92, 0.20);
        --shadow-small: 0 10px 22px rgba(23, 56, 92, 0.18);

        --font-body: Nunito, system-ui, sans-serif;
        --font-head: Fredoka, Nunito, system-ui, sans-serif;
        --font-hand: Caveat, cursive;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      html, body {
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        print-color-adjust: exact;
      }

      body {
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        color: var(--navy);
        background: var(--cream);
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      .styled-slide {
        position: relative;
        width: 1200px;
        height: 900px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: var(--cream);
      }

      .abs { position: absolute; }

      /* ── Decoration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .blob { position: absolute; z-index: 0; }
      .blob.green { background: var(--green-soft); }
      .blob.pink { background: var(--pink-soft); }
      /* Low enough that the badge row above it sits on cream: a green badge on
         the green blob disappears. */
      .blob.bottom-left { left: -120px; bottom: -140px; width: 540px; height: 230px; border-radius: 50% 60% 40% 50%; }
      .blob.bottom-right { right: -110px; bottom: -120px; width: 330px; height: 290px; border-radius: 60% 40% 50% 50%; }
      .blob.top-right { right: -90px; top: -110px; width: 300px; height: 260px; border-radius: 40% 50% 60% 50%; }

      .sparks { width: 34px; height: 34px; }
      .sparks path { stroke: var(--pink); stroke-width: 4; stroke-linecap: round; fill: none; }

      .swoosh { display: block; height: 18px; }
      .swoosh path { stroke: var(--pink); stroke-width: 7; stroke-linecap: round; fill: none; }

      /* ── Brand lockup ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; z-index: 2; }
      .brand img { width: 66px; height: 66px; object-fit: contain; }
      .brand .wordmark { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 600; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
      .brand .tagline { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2.4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); }
      .brand.small img { width: 54px; height: 54px; }
      .brand.small .wordmark { font-size: 30px; }
      .brand.small .tagline { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; }

      /* ── Type ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .headline { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -1.5px; color: var(--navy); z-index: 2; }

      .hand { font-family: var(--font-hand); font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.05; z-index: 3; }
      .hand.pill { background: var(--pink-soft); border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 26px 10px; }
      .hand.pill.green { background: var(--green-soft); }

      /* ── Feature list ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .features { display: flex; flex-direction: column; z-index: 2; }
      .feature { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
      .icon-circle { flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 50%; }
      .icon-circle svg { width: 50%; height: 50%; fill: currentColor; }
      .icon-circle.pink { background: var(--pink-soft); color: var(--pink-deep); }
      .icon-circle.green { background: var(--green-soft); color: var(--green-deep); }
      .feature .title { font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.15; }
      .feature .sub { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 2px; }

      /* ── Badges ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .badges { display: flex; gap: 14px; z-index: 2; }
      .badge { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.1; white-space: nowrap; }
      .badge.pink { background: var(--pink-soft); }
      .badge.green { background: var(--green-soft); }

      /* ── Paper ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .page-card { background: var(--white); border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-page); overflow: hidden; }
      .page-card img { display: block; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%= yield %>
  </body>
</html>
